       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     TINITPT.
       AUTHOR.         ANNETTE KRAUSS.
       INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
       DATE-WRITTEN.
      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *D*                                                             *
      *D*   T I N I T P T                                             *
      *D*                                                             *
      *D*   THIS PROGRAM IS USED TO INITIALLY LOAD THE                *
      *D*   STORES DATA BASE FOR STARTUP ON CSIS. THE FIELDS          *
      *D*   LOADED ARE NECESSARY FOR MANY OF THE CSIS                 *
      *D*   PROGRAMS TO RUN.  THE FOLLOWING DATA IS LOADED.           *
      *D*                                                             *
      *D*   THIS PROGRAM IS TO BE USED IN THE DOMESTIC                *
      *D*   PLANTS ONLY.                                              *
      *D*                                                             *
      *D* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *C*   CHANGES
      *C*   OCT 1992    CR KALMAN        REQ: 6268
      *C*   CHANGED MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT FROM 9V9(4) TO V9(5). ALSO
      *C*   CHANGED ALL INITIALIZING VALUES ACCORDINGLY.
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  ALL-ITEMS            PIC XX    VALUE "@;".
       77  DSET-NAME            PIC X(16) VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1    PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2    PIC X     VALUE SPACES.

9406CK 01  SCOPE   PIC X.

       COPY DATAB IN COPYLIB.

       COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYLIB.

       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.

       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       BEGIN-PROC.
9406CK     MOVE "C" TO SCOPE.
9406CK     CALL "MCXCBLERR" USING SCOPE.

           MOVE "TINITPT"  TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN OUTPUT MPLTINFO-O.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN             THRU 6-MAIN-EXIT.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-O.
           GOBACK.

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                 BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

       6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 61-ADD-TMP THRU 61-ADD-TMP-EXIT.
           PERFORM 62-ADD-TMD THRU 62-ADD-TMD-EXIT.
       6-MAIN-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       61-ADD-TMP.
           MOVE SPACES                 TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMP1"                 TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "NET  "                TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT-DESC.
9210CK     MOVE .00000                 TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 61-ADD-TMP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMP1"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                 TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMP2"                 TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "1/2% "                TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT-DESC.
9210CK     MOVE .00500                 TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 61-ADD-TMP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMP2"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                 TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMP3"                 TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "1%   "                TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT-DESC.
9210CK     MOVE .01000                 TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 61-ADD-TMP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMP3"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                 TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMP4"                 TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "2%   "                TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT-DESC.
9210CK     MOVE .02000                 TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 61-ADD-TMP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMP4"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                 TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMP5"                 TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "3%   "                TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT-DESC.
9210CK     MOVE .03000                 TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 61-ADD-TMP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMP5"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                 TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMP6"                 TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "5%   "                TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT-DESC.
9210CK     MOVE .05000                 TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 61-ADD-TMP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMP5"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                 TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMP9"                 TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE " SEE "                TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT-DESC.
9210CK     MOVE .00000                 TO MPLTINFO-DISC-AMNT.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 61-ADD-TMP" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMP9"  TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       61-ADD-TMP-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       62-ADD-TMD.
           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDA"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "AT ONCE           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDA" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDB"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "10 DAYS           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "010"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDB" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDC"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "15 DAYS           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "015"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDC" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDD"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "20 DAYS           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "020"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDD" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDE"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "30 DAYS           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "030"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDE" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDF"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "60 DAYS           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "060"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDF" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDG"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "90 DAYS           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "090"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDG" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDH"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "10 TH PROX        "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "010"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "P"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDH" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDI"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "15 TH PROX        "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "015"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "P"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDI" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDJ"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "20 TH PROX        "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "020"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "P"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDJ" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDK"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "25 TH PROX        "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "025"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "P"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDK" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDL"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "10 TH & 25 TH PROX"     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "010"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "P"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "025"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "P"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDL" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDM"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "15 TH & 30 TH PROX"     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "015"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "P"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "030"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "P"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDM" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDN"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "CASH WITH ORDER   "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDN" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDO"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "7 DAYS            "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "007"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDO" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDP"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "CONTRA            "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDP" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDQ"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "120 DAYS          "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "120"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDQ" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDS"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "150 DAYS          "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "150"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDS" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDT"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "180 DAYS          "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "180"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDT" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDU"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "22 DAYS           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "022"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "TMDU" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDW"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "25 DAYS           "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "025"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "D"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
           WRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE "DBPUT ERROR IN 62-ADD-TMD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
               MOVE "TMDW" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)

           MOVE SPACES                   TO BUF-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "TMDZ"                   TO MPLTINFO-KEY.
           MOVE "BELOW             "     TO MPLTINFO-TMD-DESC.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-TIME-FLAG.
           MOVE "000"                    TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-2.
           MOVE "N"                      TO MPLTINFO-D-OR-P-FLAG.
